{
 "__fileName__": "enUS_Text/meta/StringList/Conv_S09_QST_Main_06b_20.stl",
 "__snoID__": 2264850,
 "__type__": "StringListDefinition",
 "__typeHash__": 3672216444,
 "arStrings": [
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "MenuLabel",
   "szText": "\"Saying goodbye?\"",
   "hLabel": 4215274549
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line6.21FCD5",
   "szText": "On the contrary. Saying a long overdue “hello.” An “I missed you.”",
   "hLabel": 780190033
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line10.21FCD5",
   "szText": "“I’m sorry.”",
   "hLabel": 1532832316
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir10.21FCD5",
   "szText": "wry",
   "hLabel": 2992164777
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line12.21FCD5",
   "szText": "I blamed Donan for doing as I thought Horadrim did. Swooping in, hiding messes. Leaving them to be discovered by the survivors of their mistakes.",
   "hLabel": 870372350
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line14.21FCD5",
   "szText": "But that’s not it, is it? What they do is try. They spit in the face of futility. “Justice and light.” That was the oath he took. And he sacrificed everything to fulfill it.",
   "hLabel": 207912384
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line16.21FCD5",
   "szText": "I couldn’t take up their mantle, but I could stand to carry out their mission, here in Scosglen.",
   "hLabel": 3840419714
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line20.229BD8",
   "szText": "...Or, you could not abandon your dear friend, and instead return to the college with me. They’d have you back, you know. Begrudgingly, but still.",
   "hLabel": 3486712435
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line18.21FCD5",
   "szText": "Hm...",
   "hLabel": 3177959748
  }
 ],
 "ptMapStringTable": "0"
}
